  "aiContextParagraph": "Law enforcement agencies in East Jakarta are currently managing public safety responses following a fatal brawl in Cakung that resulted in the arrests of five suspects. Investigations indicated the altercation was organized via social media using specific terms, such as 'COD' and 'paketin' to coordinate meeting times. Following the incident, police have taken further actions, including the detention of 11 teenagers attempting to initiate separate conflicts in the East Jakarta and Bekasi regions, where seven sharp weapons were seized. While local authorities report that the overall frequency of brawls in East Jakarta has declined by approximately 50 percent, police are now closely monitoring new areas where these activities appear to be migrating. Beyond the capital, similar concerns regarding violent altercations involving weapons have been reported in other provinces, prompting expanded security measures by local police departments.",
